==Location and Uses==
==={{TFH|-}}===
{{Descriptions TFH}}
The Tingle Tights are an [[Outfit]] in {{TFH}} that can be crafted at [[Madame Couture's]] after [[Link]] has completed the [[Forest Temple (Tri Force Heroes)|Forest Temple]]. The Outfit dresses Link in [[Tingle]]'s signature bodysuit, complete with his clock pendant, rosy cheeks, and facial hair and mole.

Wearers of the Tingle Tights begin each [[Levels in Tri Force Heroes|Level]] with three balloons tied to their waists. These balloons save the wearer from losing [[Health]] or failing the "'''Don't fall at all!'''" [[Drablands Challenge]] when falling off ledges. This ability works up to three times per Level, as one balloon will pop after each fall.<ref name="TFH Pick an Outfit"/> The ability also works for falling into [[Lava]], but not for falling into [[Quicksand]].

==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Tingle's Tights are only available when {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack is active. After beginning the "[[EX Treasure: Fairy Clothes]]" [[Side Quest]], Tingle's Tights can be found in the [[Mabe Village Ruins]]. They are part of [[Tingle's Outfit]], along with [[Tingle's Shirt]] and [[Tingle's Hood]]. Wearing the full [[Armor Set]] will give [[Link]] the [[Night Speed Up]] [[Set Bonus]].

